  cpp_block_err_target.pcpp - break step of cpp_block.pcpp:
  cppstart takes header or source (PR0015)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\cpp_block_err_target.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\cpp_block_err_target.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
